                    1951.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d176-f2" n="2" xml:id="d176-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed, but see footnote 2 to the memorandum of September 5, <ref
                        target="#pg264">p. 264</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d176-f3" n="3" xml:id="d176-f3-content">
                <p> ISAC D-4/8, “Economic Analysis of the Allocation of the MTDP ‘Gap’ to European
                    Countries,” June 25, 1951, is not printed. For information concerning this ISAC
                    paper, see the letter from Cabot to Marshall of June 25, <ref target="#pg205">p.
                        205</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d176-f4" n="4" xml:id="d176-f4-content">
                <p>For documentation concerning this North Atlantic Council resolution, see telegram
                    Secto 23 from Ottawa, September 19, <ref target="#pg677">pp. 677</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
